code_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/971302-debate-the-escheat#post971302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I gave the thread a generic name as im sure we all have questions on it.<br /> <br /> But for my question, one on my mind right now<br /> <br /> does the right of life apply to dauntain,<br /> <br /> either the legal, &quot;a noble will put you on trial and kick your ass&quot; or the mechanical, you gain a point of temporary banality.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Legally? Did you piss off the Noble? Was the Dauntain previously someone close to the noble? Has the Noble been hurt by the Dauntain? Do you have political enemies who would push it through?<br /> <br /> the Dreaming? Absofuckingultely. The Dreaming isn't fair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T14:17:33-07:00","id":971521,"title":"","content":"Safe to say that most Nobles will probaly sigh and shake their heads at such a death.<br /> <br /> Hmmmn another worthwhile question does the right of life cover all forms of Death.<br /> <br /> Chimerical, physical and fae? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.pn